slow down, Joel.

787
00:34:46,880 --> 00:34:48,380
Who knows?

788
00:34:48,380 --> 00:34:51,390
-Hey. Hey up there.
-I myself can learn.

789
00:34:52,390 --> 00:34:54,390
So as you can see...

790
00:34:54,890 --> 00:34:56,390
Man, Willie Nelson's
a tough audience.

791
00:34:56,390 --> 00:34:58,900
