935
00:40:19,210 --> 00:40:20,710
Oh, no!

936
00:40:20,710 --> 00:40:22,210
Gah.

937
00:40:24,220 --> 00:40:25,220
Thatch?

938
00:40:25,720 --> 00:40:26,720
Coppola!

939
