Mm, something smells good.

964
00:41:54,310 --> 00:41:56,310
[ Caveman chatter ]

965
00:41:57,810 --> 00:41:59,820
Ugh, cannibal rhubarb.
Ugh.

966
00:41:59,810 --> 00:42:02,310
Ator comes out of the hole,
'round the fire-

