987
00:43:17,890 --> 00:43:18,890
Oh, yeah?

988
00:43:18,890 --> 00:43:20,400
Yeah, ask away,
my red friend.

989
00:43:20,890 --> 00:43:22,890
[ Laughs ] Why is it
these guys in the film

990
00:43:22,900 --> 00:43:25,400
