-Mm-hm.

1591
01:09:10,610 --> 01:09:14,110
-I have only one thing to say.
-Plastics.

1592
01:09:14,610 --> 01:09:16,110
We will meet again.

1593
01:09:16,110 --> 01:09:18,610
Don't know where,
don't know when.

1594
01:09:19,120 --> 01:09:21,620
Your master
has taught me one thing:

1595
01:09:22,620 --> 01:09:25,630
