1665
01:12:07,790 --> 01:12:08,790
Uh-huh.

1666
01:12:09,290 --> 01:12:10,790
No, no!

1667
01:12:10,790 --> 01:12:11,790
I beg you!

1668
01:12:11,790 --> 01:12:14,290
