[ Hissing ]

1670
01:12:17,800 --> 01:12:18,800
Yeah.

1671
01:12:19,800 --> 01:12:21,800
Oh, this is a Comfort Rest
adjustable bed.

1672
01:12:22,800 --> 01:12:26,310
[ Wails ] No, no!

1673
01:12:29,810 --> 01:12:33,310
Oh, look. Anal retentive snakes.
