1674
01:12:33,810 --> 01:12:35,820
No! [ Screams ]

1675
01:12:38,320 --> 01:12:39,820
Shut up. Come on.

1676
01:12:41,320 --> 01:12:43,820
I'd like to move that hair
out of his face. Geez.

1677
01:12:43,820 --> 01:12:45,830
-Yeah.
-[ Wails ]

1678
01:12:48,330 --> 01:12:50,330
Aw, he's taking her home
