1679
01:12:54,830 --> 01:12:55,330
Bye.

1680
01:12:55,830 --> 01:12:56,830
That was neat.

1681
01:12:56,830 --> 01:12:57,830
All right, you're next.
Come on!

1682
01:12:57,840 --> 01:12:59,340
[ Whimpers ] No!

1683
01:12:59,340 --> 01:13:00,840
In you go.

1684
01:13:01,340 --> 01:13:03,340
Psst, hey, Ator,

1685
01:13:03,340 --> 01:13:06,850
I'm behind the filler
linoleum post over here.

1686
01:13:06,840 --> 01:13:08,840
Yeah, it's cool.

1687
01:13:10,350 --> 01:13:11,850
[ Wails ]
[ Growling ]

1688
01:13:11,850 --> 01:13:13,350
-What's he gonna do?
-Ow!

1689
01:13:13,350 --> 01:13:14,350
Ooh.

1690
01:13:14,850 --> 01:13:17,850
Accept, oh lord of serpents
and evil, this fifth maiden,

1691
01:13:18,360 --> 01:13:20,860
which we,
your servants offer you.

1692
01:13:21,860 --> 01:13:24,870
May your spirit and strength
be transmitted to us

1693
01:13:24,860 --> 01:13:25,860
so that we may reign--

1694
01:13:25,860 --> 01:13:26,860
Have to cut through your wrist.

1695
01:13:27,870 --> 01:13:28,870
Now the man.

1696
01:13:29,870 --> 01:13:31,870
Always knew
I would be an apostle.

1697
01:13:31,870 --> 01:13:34,370
Ouch, I landed
on my eight-sided dice.

1698
01:13:35,370 --> 01:13:36,870
